<title>GERMANY: German car and van output, exports rise in June.</title>
<headline>German car and van output, exports rise in June.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>German car and van production and export figures for June and the first six months of 1997 issued by the German Automobile Industry Association VDA showed a rise in output and exports</p>
<p>    Production	    June 1997	   Change vs June 1996</p>
<p>    Passenger vehicles    440,400	     up 15 pct</p>
<p>    Vans			 29,900	     up 31 pct</p>
<p>    Trucks up to 6 tonnes  18,400	     up 25 pct</p>
<p>    Heavy trucks	     11,500	     up 42 pct</p>
<p>    All vehicles	    470,300	     up 16 pct</p>
<p>    Exports		 June 1997	   Change vs June 1995</p>
<p>    Passenger vehicles    261,700	     up 17 pct</p>
<p>    Vans			 20,000	     up 34 pct</p>
<p>    Trucks up to 6 tonnes  12,700	     up 31 pct</p>
<p>    Heavy trucks		7,300	     up 40 pct</p>
<p>    All vehicles	    281,700	     up 18 pct</p>
<p>The VDA also released the following data for six-month sales:</p>
<p>    Production	    Jan-June 1997     Change vs 96 period</p>
<p>    Passenger vehicles  2,431,000		up 2 pct</p>
<p>    Vans			170,700		up 11 pct</p>
<p>    Trucks up to 6 tonnes 105,000		up 13 pct</p>
<p>    Heavy trucks	     65,800		up 8 pct</p>
<p>    All vehicles	  2,601,800		up 3 pct</p>
<p>    Exports		 Jan-June 1997     Change vs 96 period</p>
<p>    Passenger vehicles  1,449,800		up 7 pct</p>
<p>    Vans			108,700		up 12 pct</p>
<p>    Trucks up to 6 tonnes  69,400		up 14 pct</p>
<p>    Heavy trucks	     39,300		up 8 pct</p>
<p>    All vehicles	  1,558,500		up 7 pct</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
